  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Rule - does the press take the line","summary":"The pointer is pressed on the chart. Does the press take her charted line, so that it can be pulled through a new point, or is it the chart''s (a drag of the map, a click to sail)? The game asks this graph at every press on the open chart with a course set (GameRules.PressTakesLine, from MapView).","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"48feda57-4213-4933-8e15-ae9142976f1b","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.PressTakesLineRule","$id":"9"},{"how":"AtMost","defaultValues":{"a":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"b":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":520.0,"y":40.0},"guid":"a4f9f331-9440-4d8c-a46e-ff305fe84eb1","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.IsIt","$id":"11"},{"defaultValues":{"when":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"yes":{"$content":1.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"no":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":960.0,"y":40.0},"guid":"f0d8a78a-ed83-454a-ab23-e01f067972bb","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.ThisOrThat","$id":"13"},{"defaultValues":{"number":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":1360.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"b3c9cbe0-410a-4c4c-9654-5892d5f582b0","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.RuleAnswer","$id":"15"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"5b0f609e-59bd-4d1d-b7a2-577cd261a56b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"distance","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"a","guid":"945e799b-2085-4a18-85eb-7d9d25a45f31","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"hold","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"b","guid":"36dc1a32-f3c9-48a4-987d-b5c22ab4740a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"when","guid":"d3504dfb-32a8-421e-bd79-2c8d40c8dff6","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"sourceKey":"picked","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"number","guid":"edc456ce-4bfb-4ab2-aa3a-84d3b31f759f","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-80.0,"xMax":1760.0,"yMax":340.0},"label":"Does the press take the line","comment":"Your ruling of 13 October 2026: pull the line anywhere. As first made, the line is taken when the pointer is within so many pixels of it (the chart gives nine).","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"eb906d91-4978-452c-a67e-a6e3c74779c6","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":220.0,"xMax":600.0,"yMax":350.0},"title":"What the game gives","body":"Pixels from the line: how far the pointer is from the nearest stroke of her course still ahead of her, on the chart as it is shown. Pixels the line is held from: the chart''s own reach for a press (MapView.KnotHoldPx).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"363d2c9c-0415-4516-8cce-2068a03423b1","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
